        <div><a name="_2a232178-e881-1bed-ba0d-e103057c567d" id="_2a232178-e881-1bed-ba0d-e103057c567d"></a><h2>3.16<span class="fmt-clause-delim">.</span><span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>tileMatrixSet</h2>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_65ead336-cd33-779b-1928-79eea44905d4" id="_65ead336-cd33-779b-1928-79eea44905d4"></a>A definition of a tile matrix set following the Tile Matrix Set standard. For tileset metadata, such a description (in <tt>tileMatrixSet</tt> property) is only required for offline use, as an alternative to a link with a <tt><a href="http://www.opengis.net/def/rel/ogc/1.0/tiling-scheme">http://www.opengis.net/def/rel/ogc/1.0/tiling-scheme</a></tt> relation type.</p>

